        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145540,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nauczmy się pisać instrukcje warunkowe, które obsługują określone warunki, takie jak te w poniższym interfejsie gry.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;stateImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;state&quot;&gt;Exploring&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Player Health: &lt;span id=&quot;hp&quot;&gt;60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt; 0 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;100&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 100 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const hp = document.getElementById(&quot;hp&quot;);&#xA;    hp.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;stateImage&quot;);&#xA;    const state = document.getElementById(&quot;state&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 20) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Critical Health&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 50) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;In Danger&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 80) {&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Exploring&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 100) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Powered Up&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Full Health&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145541,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podczas przesuwania suwaka ten interfejs gry używa instrukcji warunkowych, aby wyświetlać różne stany gracza, gdy zdrowie jest mniejsze od określonych wartości.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;stateImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;state&quot;&gt;Exploring&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Player Health: &lt;span id=&quot;hp&quot;&gt;60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt; 0 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;100&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 100 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const hp = document.getElementById(&quot;hp&quot;);&#xA;    hp.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;stateImage&quot;);&#xA;    const state = document.getElementById(&quot;state&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 20) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Critical Health&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 50) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;In Danger&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 80) {&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Exploring&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 100) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Powered Up&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Full Health&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145542,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Za pomocą instrukcji if i else możemy napisać program, który wyświetla jeden komunikat, jeśli <code>health &lt; 50</code> ma wartość <code>true</code>, a inny, jeśli ma wartość <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is doing fine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>health</code>, następnie <code>&lt;</code> i na końcu <code>50</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145543,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W przypadku bardziej szczegółowego warunku, na przykład gdy <code>health</code> nie jest mniejsze niż <code>50</code>, ale jest mniejsze niż <code>80</code>, możemy zamiast tego napisać <code>else if (health &lt; 80)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(health &gt; 200)\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>else</code>, następnie <code>if</code> i na końcu <code>(health &lt; 80)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145544,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nazywamy to <strong>instrukcją else if</strong>. Ta instrukcja uruchamia swój blok kodu, jeśli poprzedzający ją warunek ma wartość <code>false</code>, a <code>health &lt; 80</code> ma wartość <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>health</code>, następnie <code>&lt;</code> i na końcu <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145545,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy zaprogramować instrukcję <code>else</code>, aby wykonywała swój blok kodu, gdy warunki <code>if</code> i <code>else if</code> mają wartość <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(health &lt; 100)\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"142\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"144\" /><option startIndex=\"183\" endIndex=\"184\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is powered up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>else</code>, następnie <code>{</code> i na końcu <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145546,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy dodać dowolną liczbę instrukcji <code>else if</code>, o ile znajdują się przed instrukcją <code>else</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"142\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"145\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is powered up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is at full health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>else</code>, następnie <code>if</code>, a potem <code>else</code>, <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145547,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Few enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy wave incoming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Enemy wave incoming</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Few enemies</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Enemy wave incoming</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
